@startuml fig8_seq_field_report
!include _style.iuml
title Figure 8 (Section 6.4). Sequence Diagram: Offline Field Report and Sync
autonumber
actor "Caseworker" as W
participant "Phone PWA\n(React)" as P
database "On-device storage\n(IndexedDB\nkilosunlad_field)" as IDB
participant "Gateway / API\n(Express)" as API
participant "Submission service\n(geofence + hash check)" as S
database "MongoDB\n(transaction)" as DB

W -> P : Start in-person visit
P -> P : 5-step form (house, assets,\ncash card, photo, recommendation)
P -> P : take photo; read GPS;\nSHA-256 of the photo bytes
W -> P : Save Report on This Device
P -> IDB : queue report (PENDING_SYNC)
alt no signal or server down
  P --> W : "Saved on this phone"\n(button: Connect to the internet to send)
  ... connection returns ...
end
P -> API : POST /tasks/:id/submit (multipart)\nBearer JWT
API -> API : JWT, role CASE_WORKER,\nown task, jurisdiction, Joi
API -> S : submit(report, photo)
S -> S : re-hash photo == client hash?\nGPS within 250 m of the house?
alt check fails (4xx)
  S --> API : 4xx: 422 GEOFENCE_VIOLATION,\n409 TASK_NOT_SUBMITTABLE (already sent)
  API --> P : error
  P -> IDB : mark ERROR\n("Rejected by server", no retry)
else checks pass
  S -> DB : store photo by its hash;\ntask -> SUBMITTED;\nappend REPORT_SUBMITTED block
  DB --> S : commit + audit receipt
  S --> API : 200 + receipt
  API --> P : 200
  P -> IDB : mark SYNCED
  P --> W : Sent; task leaves the list
end
note over P, IDB : A 5xx or network error keeps the report\nPENDING_SYNC and it is retried later.\nThe server refuses duplicates, so a report\nis never stored twice.
@enduml
